  "title": "Townhouse for rent in Vancouver, Vancouver West, 6558 Arbutus Street, 263172550 | Realtylink.org",
  "bodyText": "Search\nBuy\nSell\nMy REALTOR®\nMarket Tools\nLog in\nTownhouse for rent\n6558 Arbutus Street, S.W. Marine, Vancouver\nGoogle Maps\nStreet View\n$4,790\n/month\n27\nFeatures\n?\nLifestyle\n 3 bedrooms\n 3 bathrooms\nFloor Area\n1,271 sqft\nLaundry Features\nIn Unit\nAppliances\nDishwasher, Microwave, Refrigerator\nParking Spaces\n2\nBylaws Restriction\nSmoking Restrictions\nDescription\nBannister Mews is one of the most distinguished townhome developments in Kerrisdale in recent years. Located at Arbutus and W.49th built within a retained and restored historic stone wall, this project combines architectural cues that exemplify characters of this historic neighbourhood with modern luxurious interior design. This 1,271sf, 3 levels, 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms townhouse features hardwood and engineered laminate floors throughout. Up the foyer to the main living area is the huge rectangular living room, dining area with ceiling fan and kitchen. The gourmet kitchen comes with shaker wood cabinetry, granite countertop, stainless steel Bosch and Fisher & Paykel appliances. Note: no more than two unrelated occupants are allowed for insurance restrictions reasons.\nMLS® No.  R3150923\nLocation\nWalk Score\n89\nIn accordance with our Terms of Use, location data are provided to you “as-is”, without warranty. Any liability arising from location data is expressly excluded.\nListing REALTOR®\nDaniel Wang\nREALTOR®\nSunstar Realty Ltd.\nContact the REALTOR®\nShowing with the Listing REALTOR®\n\nBook an appointment with the listing REALTOR® to tour the property at your own pace, in person.\n\nRequest a showing\nCalculators\nMortgage payments\nPrice of property\n$\nDown payment\n$\n%\nMortgage amount\n$0.00\nInterest rate\n%\nAmortization\nyears\nPayment frequency\nMonthly\nCalculate\nPayment amount\n$0.00\nSee monthly payment chart\nProperty transfer tax\nFair Market Value\n$\nCalculate\n1% of $200,000\n$0.00\n2% of remaining value up to and including $2,000,000\n$0.00\n3% of remaining portion over $2,000,000\n$0.00\nEstimated Property Transfer Tax\n$0.00\nBorrowing capacity\nPayment amount\n$\nPayment frequency\nMonthly\nInterest rate\n%\nAmortization\nyears\nCalculate\nMortgage amount\n$0.00\nThe amounts shown above are for information purposes only and do not include taxes, if applicable.\nYou must purchase mortgage default insurance if your down payment is less than 20 per cent of the purchase price of the property.\nThis calculator doesn't calculate the further 2% tax on residential property greater than $3,000,000 or the additional property transfer tax on residential property transfers to foreign entities or taxable trustees. Learn more about property transfer tax.\nThere are additional costs to buying a home. Speak with your REALTOR® for more information.\nDISCOVER REALTYLINK.ORG\n\nRealtylink.org is a property search website hosted by REALTORS® at Greater Vancouver REALTORS®, Fraser Valley Real Estate Board, Vancouver Island Real Estate Board, BC Northern Real Estate Board, and Chilliwack and District Real Estate Board.\n\nDiscover Realtylink.org\nWORKING WITH A REALTOR®\n\nWhether you’re buying or selling a home, it’s important to understand from the outset how professional representation can help you at every step of the process.\n\nHow Realtors help\nCONTACT REALTYLINK.ORG\n\nDo you have any questions or comments for us?\n\nContact Realtylink.org\nView regions\n\n\n\nThe trademarks REALTOR®, REALTORS®, and the REALTOR® logo are controlled by The Canadian Real Estate Association (CREA) and identify real estate professionals who are members of CREA. The trademarks MLS®, Multiple Listing Service® and the associated logos are owned by CREA and identify the quality of services provided by real estate professionals who are members of CREA.\n\n© Centris 2026. All rights reserved.\nSite privacy policy and terms of use",
